{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/a9810760f0d0e434dff46a440828b1b6.webp?t=1774616291\" width=51 height=51 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Main Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upon receiving news of his father's illness, Lin Ye hurried back to China. His mother entrusted him with the management of the family's homestay business. How will Lin Ye turn around the struggling, neglected homestay with its incomplete facilities? During this process, how will he encounter six girls, each with their own unique personality? What kind of stories will unfold between them and the protagonist...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An interactive visual novel centered around straightforward and intuitive homestay management and development. Progress through the story to experience humorous and heartwarming love stories with the main female characters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/a9810760f0d0e434dff46a440828b1b6.webp?t=1774616291\" width=51 height=51 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Main Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/\u767d\u971c\u513f?t=1774616291\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bai Shuang'er, Lin Ye's childhood friend, trusted partner, and confidante.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/\u82cf\u7476?t=1774616291\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Su Yao, an ice queen and married painter who is cold on the outside but warm on the inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/\u5b8b\u6653\u8431?t=1774616291\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Song Xiaoxuan, cute yet strong, with a pure and delicate appearance but a powerful inner core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/6ad40e66643e1cadb719e308bd141c9f.avif?t=1774616291\" width=1280 height=2240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chen Yue, gentle like water, bringing a spring-like warmth to everyone she meets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/extras/a9810760f0d0e434dff46a440828b1b6.webp?t=1774616291\" width=51 height=51 /></span>\u00a0<strong>The following characters are in development, please stay tuned:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Chen Youyou, a rebellious and free-spirited personality, competitive and stubborn, somewhat incongruous between her words and thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Michelle, a friend of Lin Ye's from his study abroad days, rumored to have not always looked this way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893300?t=1774616291","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/17538f31a4ae615505aeccf01e364c3105f02fad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774616291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893300/e5ae6b45629